    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d25">

                <pb facs="0137" n="21" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg21"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 835.001/35a.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            Secretary of State for Foreign Affairs of
                            Argentina.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-10">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 10, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I profoundly deplore the bereavement which afflicts the great nation of Argentina
                    in the death of its illustrious President, Doctor Saenz Pena, whose loss will be
                    mourned not only in the country over which he so worthily presided but
                    throughout the civilized world.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">W. J. Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
